{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"farm_field_t3","model_identifier":"farm_field_t3","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# farm_field_t3\n\nFarm field tier 3: a dry-stone wall, a well and a scarecrow round the dug rows.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 8 columns (128 x 128 units, 3.60 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -64..67, y 0..53, z -64..64 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 39, construction_0 15, construction_33 15, construction_66 13, ruined 13 (2 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 131 x 53 x 128 (w x h x d), centred at x 2, z 0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `farm_field_t3_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `farm_field_t3_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_farm_field_t3` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 0, -72)\n- `slot_row_1` at (0, 3, -32)\n- `slot_row_2` at (0, 3, -16)\n- `slot_row_3` at (0, 3, 0)\n- `slot_row_4` at (0, 3, 16)\n- `slot_row_5` at (0, 3, 32)\n- `slot_row_6` at (0, 3, 48)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"row_bed","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-54.0,0.0,-40.0],"to":[54.0,1.0,56.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[130.0,198.0,238.0,199.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,200.0,96.0,201.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[130.0,198.0,238.0,199.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,200.0,96.0,201.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[12.0,0.0,120.0,96.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[12.0,0.0,120.0,96.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"17ce43ea-29cf-579e-88c3-0734b12e8246"},{"name":"row0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-54.0,1.0,-37.0],"to":[54.0,3.0,-27.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[88.0,192.0,196.0,194.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[52.0,198.0,62.0,200.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[88.0,192.0,196.0,194.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[52.0,198.0,62.0,200.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,144.0,108.0,154.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,144.0,108.0,154.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"96c45014-4185-5daa-970c-ad9791805fbf"},{"name":"row0_top","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-54.0,3.0,-35.0],"to":[54.0,4.5,-29.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,196.5,108.0,198.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[92.0,198.5,98.0,200.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,196.5,108.0,198.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[92.0,198.5,98.0,200.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,174.0,108.0,180.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,174.0,108.0,180.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a6f8846b-8cb0-5f2f-86a3-a55a09f9cc56"},