se,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[]},{"name":"slot_row_4","origin":[0.0,3.0,16.0],"color":0,"uuid":"61ace0f1-fc8c-57c1-a92a-912fc5e4dea2","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[]},{"name":"slot_row_5","origin":[0.0,3.0,32.0],"color":0,"uuid":"ce8cf41b-f31b-56a6-bcf9-e0d6da38c206","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[]},{"name":"slot_row_6","origin":[0.0,3.0,48.0],"color":0,"uuid":"67d3c612-ca3d-5019-a8d6-e73e5cf06735","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[]}]}],"textures":[{"path":"farm_field_t3.png","name":"farm_field_t3.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":256,"height":256,"uv_width":256,"uv_height":256,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"46a576a9-71ed-5bf5-83f2-0865c7fab8cb","relative_path":"farm_field_t3.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[],"description":"# farm_field_t3\n\nFarm field tier 3: a dry-stone wall, a well and a scarecrow round the dug rows.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 8 columns (128 x 128 units, 3.60 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -64..67, y 0..53, z -64..64 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 39, construction_0 15, construction_33 15, construction_66 13, ruined 13 (2 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 131 x 53 x 128 (w x h x d), centred at x 2, z 0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `farm_field_t3_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `farm_field_t3_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_farm_field_t3` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 0, -72)\n- `slot_row_1` at (0, 3, -32)\n- `slot_row_2` at (0, 3, -16)\n- `slot_row_3` at (0, 3, 0)\n- `slot_row_4` at (0, 3, 16)\n- `slot_row_5` at (0, 3, 32)\n- `slot_row_6` at (0, 3, 48)\n"}